3,"Kanasi alphabet, prounciation and language - Omniglot",https://www.omniglot.com/writing/kanasi.htm,"Kanasi is a Trans-New Guinea language spoken in Milne Bay Province of Papua New Guinea by about 2,200 people. It is a member of the Dagan branch of the Trans-New Guinea language family.",Kanasi,Trans-New Guinea
