9,Kanasi,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Kanasi.htm,"Language name and location: Kanasi, Papua New Guinea [Refer to Ethnologue].Other comments: Kanasi is spoken by approximately 2,400 speakers in Rabaraba district, Milne Bay province, Papua New Guinea. The Kanasi or Sona numbering system is only used as far as '15'.",Kanasi,Trans-New Guinea
